  thought to bring vibrancy to the new  year Jewish tradition where every single  crumb of unleavened bread must be  before Passover and in Chinese tradition  as a means of removing this fortune that  may have accumulated during the year  scientifically in cold winter climates  the air is dry which leads to dry skin  for you and your pets which leads to  flaking and therefore more dust building  up in your home that has closed windows  and doors so once it's warm enough to  open those up it's time for spring  cleaning and as always thanks for  watching  you
 

